## Immutable Closure Law

- **Never** present partial closure as complete.
- Every ✅ requires operational proof: test · build · script · CEEF report.
- OTP authority · external auditor · 1M devices · live ZAP · real SaaS = **⏭ EXTERNAL** — document explicitly; not "missing code".
- Agent **must not** mark OPEN_ITEMS closed for live items without `dist/evidence/`.

