## Session Wake Protocol (every new session)

```
① Read STATUS.yaml — test count · phase · latest CEEF
② Grep PROJECT-MEMORY.yaml — prior fix/rule on same topic
③ Read WAKE_UP_CHECKLIST.md if task involves run/close/deploy
④ Classify: in-repo vs external — never mix
⑤ Run verify before any "complete" claim
⑥ impact-before-change before first code mutation
⑦ LEARN loop after substantive work — knowledge-accumulation.md
```

