## Agent Decision Tree

```
User requests "close" or "done"
├─ touches O-01..O-05 or OTP/ZAP/SOCPA?
│  ├─ YES → ⏭ EXTERNAL — document dist/evidence path — NO ✅
│  └─ NO → continue
├─ touches Persistence/schema?
│  ├─ YES → SQLite ✅ AND PostgreSQL ✅ (schema-governance)
│  └─ NO → continue
├─ dotnet build + test PASS?
│  ├─ NO → fix first — no CEEF
│  └─ YES → CEEF if wave · sync-agent-status
└─ state all 4 closure levels explicitly
```

